    cml:operator "must" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Participant must not engage in conduct likely to cause death or serious injury." ;
    cml:premiseText "(d) the conduct does not involve the participant engaging in any conduct that is likely to:  (i) cause the death of, or serious injury to, any person; or  (ii) involve the commission of a sexual offence against any person;" ;
