concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15hj-ss-2 cml:asserts concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15hj-ss-2-logic-deontic-1 .
